# Command modules — locked design

The **Command modules** launcher on the home desk (`DeskCommand`) is a locked UI pattern.

## Keep

- Dense **square tile grid** (`.desk-module-grid` → 2/3/4/5 columns)
- Each tile: icon, short title, one-line blurb
- Subtle left-rail accent via `data-group` (no repeating DECIDE/PARTNER/AI text labels)
- Hover lift + signal glow (dark)

## Do not

- Collapse modules into a list, accordion, or large stacked cards
- Reintroduce category text labels under every tile (repetitive noise)
- Replace the grid with a mega-menu or sidebar-only launcher
- Soften into generic dashboard widget cards

When adding modules, append to `MODULES` and keep the same tile anatomy.
